  "worked_solution": "The general solution to our equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x+{30}^{\u2218} & =-{45}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}n, & \\, & \\, & 3x+{30}^{\u2218} & =-{135}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}n.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving the two equations above for $x,$ we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x & =-{30}^{\u2218}-{45}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}n & \\, & \\, & 3x & =-{30}^{\u2218}-{135}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}n \\\\ 3x & =-{75}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}n & \\, & \\, & 3x & =-{165}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}n \\\\ x & =-{25}^{\u2218}+{120}^{\u2218}n & \\, & \\, & x & =-{55}^{\u2218}+{120}^{\u2218}n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have that $b=-{55}^{\u2218}.$",
